# CODEOWNERS - infra/config paths that always need @glincker/glinr-owners
# review, regardless of who else approves a PR. Paired with branch
# protection's "Require review from Code Owners" on main.
#
# Everything NOT listed here has no required owner: any collaborator with
# write access (including @glincker/moderators) can review and merge it
# once it has the generic required-approval count. This is deliberate -
# it's what lets moderators merge UI/icon PRs independently while CI/CD,
# dependencies, and root config still always route through an owner.
#
# Mirrors the project's own file-boundaries policy for sensitive paths.

/.github/                 @glincker/glinr-owners
/package.json             @glincker/glinr-owners
/pnpm-lock.yaml           @glincker/glinr-owners
/pnpm-workspace.yaml      @glincker/glinr-owners
/tsconfig.json            @glincker/glinr-owners
/.env*                    @glincker/glinr-owners
/next.config.ts           @glincker/glinr-owners
/vitest.config.ts         @glincker/glinr-owners
/packages/*/package.json  @glincker/glinr-owners
